    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "India is home to Hindus, Muslims, Christians, Sikhs, Buddhists, Jains, Parsis and others. The Constitution recognises 22 languages and hundreds more are spoken.\nFestivals such as Diwali, Eid, Christmas, Guru Nanak Jayanti, Buddha Purnima and Pongal are celebrated across the country.\nRespecting differences keeps India united."
    }
